        <article
          class="legacy-release grid gap-8 border-b border-[#001B3D]/10 py-12 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(280px,400px)] md:grid-rows-[auto_auto] md:items-center lg:gap-16"
        >
          <div class="md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1">
            <div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between">
              <p
                class="font-noto-sans text-[clamp(19px,2vw,20px)] font-semibold text-[#001B3D] underline"
              >
                v1.0.0
              </p>

              <p
                class="font-noto-sans text-[clamp(14px,1.5vw,16px)] font-semibold text-[#001B3D]"
              >
                June 28th, 2026
              </p>
            </div>

            <p
              class="font-noto-sans mt-6 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(16px,1.8vw,20px)] leading-relaxed font-semibold text-[#001B3D]"
            >
              Milestone 1 marks the first major release of Persona 3 Dual. It
              introduces initial 3D exploration across multiple key locations,
              basic character interactions, a functional battle system demo, and
              core UI and settings features.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex justify-center md:col-start-2 md:row-span-2 md:row-start-1 md:justify-start"
          >
            <img
              src={rect6.src}
              alt=""
              class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[410pc] drop-shadow-[8px_8px_0_#3BAA45]"
            />
          </div>

          <div
            class="mt-2 flex justify-center md:col-start-1 md:row-start-2 md:mt-0 md:justify-start"
          >
            <Button
              as="a"
              href="https://github.com/p3d-project/persona-3-dual/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
              target="_blank"
              size="md"
              className="mx-auto w-full max-w-[410px] justify-center py-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:w-[410px] lg:py-5"
            >
              Download
            </Button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article
          class="legacy-release grid gap-8 py-12 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(280px,400px)] md:grid-rows-[auto_auto] md:items-center lg:gap-16"
        >
          <div class="md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1">
            <div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between">
              <p
