            </div>

            <p
              class="font-noto-sans mt-6 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(16px,1.8vw,20px)] leading-relaxed font-semibold text-[#001B3D]"
            >
              A pre-release for v1.0.0 focused on testing for Milestone 1.
              Standardizes character dialogue formatting, updates model assets,
              and fixes critical turn-handling and save file bugs across
